        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Through</strong> is a roguelite top-down auto-battler shooter where you command a squad of robots to break through humanity’s defense line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip powerful gear, combine hex cores to activate set effects, and fight your way through ever-changing battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment &amp; Core Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/43d72600406504299d240229bc5c15e6.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/43d72600406504299d240229bc5c15e6.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your robots’ abilities with gear obtained during battle.<br>Mix and match active, passive, and weapon equipment to define your combat style, and enjoy crafting a new build every run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach cores to the vertices of a hexagonal slot to strengthen your heroes.<br>When identical cores form lines, triangles, or hexagons, <strong>set effects</strong> are activated—one clever placement can completely turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perk Tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/1643cc3a97e5b089e772a64fae404d0c.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/1643cc3a97e5b089e772a64fae404d0c.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All gear resets after each run, but your progress does not end there.<br>Use the trait points you’ve earned to unlock permanent nodes in the <strong>Perk Tree</strong>, and build an even stronger squad for the next challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/15c3c08c8e9682df6e0326849a98e452.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/15c3c08c8e9682df6e0326849a98e452.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=829 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, you’ll encounter shops, random events, and critical choices. Each decision between <strong>risk and reward</strong> will shape the destiny of your squad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/bfdd311159ae4c74a63db807adc91515.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/bfdd311159ae4c74a63db807adc91515.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=827 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use credits earned from battles to purchase equipment in the shop and complete powerful synergy combinations.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Through</strong> is a roguelite top-down auto-battler shooter where you command a squad of robots to break through humanity’s defense line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip powerful gear, combine hex cores to activate set effects, and fight your way through ever-changing battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment &amp; Core Systems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/43d72600406504299d240229bc5c15e6.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/43d72600406504299d240229bc5c15e6.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your robots’ abilities with gear obtained during battle.<br>Mix and match active, passive, and weapon equipment to define your combat style, and enjoy crafting a new build every run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attach cores to the vertices of a hexagonal slot to strengthen your heroes.<br>When identical cores form lines, triangles, or hexagons, <strong>set effects</strong> are activated—one clever placement can completely turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perk Tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/1643cc3a97e5b089e772a64fae404d0c.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/1643cc3a97e5b089e772a64fae404d0c.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=828 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All gear resets after each run, but your progress does not end there.<br>Use the trait points you’ve earned to unlock permanent nodes in the <strong>Perk Tree</strong>, and build an even stronger squad for the next challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/15c3c08c8e9682df6e0326849a98e452.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/15c3c08c8e9682df6e0326849a98e452.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=829 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, you’ll encounter shops, random events, and critical choices. Each decision between <strong>risk and reward</strong> will shape the destiny of your squad.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Store</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras/bfdd311159ae4c74a63db807adc91515.avif?t=1763139026\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137540/extras_big/bfdd311159ae4c74a63db807adc91515.webp?t=1763139026 width=1560 height=827 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use credits earned from battles to purchase equipment in the shop and complete powerful synergy combinations.</p></li></ul>",
